Plate is about 26 cm. On it are 2 cucumber maki pieces (~20 g each, 40 g), 2 inside-out rolls with a spicy orange filling (~30 g each, 60 g), 2 spicy crab rolls with tobiko (~30 g each, 60 g), and 4 slices of baked or smoked tofu (~20–25 g each, about 90 g). That totals roughly 250 g.

Energy: sushi at about 160 g × 1.5 kcal/g gives ~240 kcal, plus a little extra for mayo, so ~260 kcal. Baked tofu at 90 g × ~1.6 kcal/g adds ~145 kcal. The total is about 400 kcal.

